msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripcion"

#. Tag: para
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:58
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>kbuildsycoca5</command> builds binary cache of the data stored in "
"<literal role=\"extension\">.desktop</literal> and MIME type <literal role="
"\"extension\">.xml</literal> files that the KService framework uses to find "
"plugins, applications and other services."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The KService library uses this database to efficiently provide the "
"information requested of it."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:70
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Users do not normally need to run this application directly; KService will "
"run it if necessary, when any of the files whose data is cached are changed."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr "Opcions"

#. Tag: option
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid "--global"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:85
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ignores any user-set files (in <varname>XDG_DATA_HOME</varname>). This is "
"currently only supported on Unix systems."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: option
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "--noincremental"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Rather than using the existing cache and only updating the information that "
"has changed or been added, start with an empty cache. Ignored if <option>--"
"global</option> is set."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: option
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "--nosignal"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Ordinarily, <command>kbuildsyscoca5</command> sends a signal over D-Bus once "
"the cache is updated to all the applications that use KService so that they "
"are always working with the latest information. This option suppresses that "
"behaviour."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: option
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "--menutest"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:106
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Test the generation of the application menu database. Does not actually "
"build the cache."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: option
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "--testmode"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:113
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use the QStandardPaths \"test mode\" to avoid interfering with user data. "
"This is intended for use with unit tests."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: option
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:118
#, no-c-format
msgid "--track <replaceable>menu-id</replaceable>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-kbuildsycoca5.8.docbook:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Track a menu ID for debugging."
msgstr ""

